      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "幽灵属性的弱点是\n幽灵属性和恶属性……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你知道这是什么意思吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E7D70755C5E602776845F3170B9662F000A5E7D70755C5E6027548C60765C5E60272026202600100001BE00000A4F6077E590538FD9662F4EC04E48610F601D5417FF1F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "知道",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "77E590530000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不知道",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D77E590530000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在幽灵属性之间，\n速度将决定对战的胜负……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285E7D70755C5E60274E4B95F4FF0C000A901F5EA65C0651B35B9A5BF96218768480DC8D1F2026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n你和我谁更擅长幽灵属性，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n来场对战比试一下吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4F60548C62118C0166F464C5957F5E7D70755C5E6027FF0C00100001BE00000A6765573A5BF962186BD48BD54E004E0B5427FF1F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等你准备好幽灵属性的宝可梦，\n就跟我说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494F6051C65907597D5E7D70755C5E602776845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A5C318DDF62118BF44E0058F05427300200100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请确保你的宝可梦\n都拥有幽灵属性再来对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7786E4FDD4F6076845B9D53EF68A6000A90FD62E567095E7D70755C5E6027518D67655BF96218300200100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谁更擅长幽灵属性，\n来场对战比试一下吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C0166F464C5957F5E7D70755C5E6027FF0C000A6765573A5BF962186BD48BD54E004E0B5427FF1F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "比试一下！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD48BD54E004E0BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么？你带的都是拥有幽灵属性的宝可梦，\n却不跟我对战吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E48FF1F4F605E26768490FD662F62E567095E7D70755C5E602776845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A53744E0D8DDF62115BF962185417FF1F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算速度比不过你也没关系，\n我还准备了力挽狂澜的对策！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B97901F5EA66BD44E0D8FC74F604E5F6CA151737CFBFF0C000A62118FD851C659074E86529B633D72C26F9C76845BF97B56FF0100100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "输掉了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F9363894E862026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了应对速度比不过对手的情况，\n我明明让宝可梦携带了咒术之符，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n提高了幽灵属性的威力来着……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E865E945BF9901F5EA66BD44E0D8FC75BF9624B768460C551B5FF0C000A6211660E660E8BA95B9D53EF68A6643A5E264E865492672F4E4B7B26FF0C00100001BE00000A63D09AD84E865E7D70755C5E602776845A01529B676577402026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不愧是让皙白先生和沐净小姐\n和解的训练家，太厉害了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D6127662F8BA97699767D5148751F548C6C9051C05C0F59D0000A548C89E376848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C592A53895BB34E862026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E48FF01FF1F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……总觉得有股寒气。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026603B89C95F97670980A15BD26C14300200100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E48FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "感觉不到",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "611F89C94E0D52300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你感觉不到吗？\n这种阴森森的气息……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n难道是沐净小姐的水晶灯火灵\n对我刚才说的话感到不满，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n于是把我的灵魂吸……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60611F89C94E0D52305417FF1F000A8FD979CD963468EE68EE76846C14606F2026202600100001BE01000A96BE9053662F6C9051C05C0F59D076846C346676706F706B7075000A5BF96211521A624D8BF476848BDD611F52304E0D6EE1FF0C00100001BE00000A4E8E662F628A6211768470759B4254382026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不要惩罚我啊～\n刚才是我说错话了啊～<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我不想失去灵魂啊～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D898160E97F5A6211554AFF5E000A521A624D662F62118BF495198BDD4E86554AFF5E00100001BE00000A62114E0D60F3593153BB70759B42554AFF5E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！\n阴森森的感觉消失了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF01000A963468EE68EE7684611F89C96D8859314E86300200100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来就算是沐净小姐不在的地方，\n皙白先生的话题也是禁忌……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67655C317B97662F6C9051C05C0F59D04E0D57287684573065B9FF0C000A7699767D5148751F76848BDD98984E5F662F79815FCC2026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是给宝可梦携带后\n能提高幽灵属性威力的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n咒术之符，就送给你了，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n请收下吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F7ED95B9D53EF68A6643A5E26540E000A80FD63D09AD85E7D70755C5E60275A01529B768400100001BE00000A5492672F4E4B7B26FF0C5C3190017ED94F604E86FF0C00100001BE00000A8BF765364E0B5427300200100002011401650000",
